# Kamerton env allowlist — the SSOT for METALOGOS_ENV_ALLOWLIST.
#
# Per AGENTS.md §4: reading the environment inside serve route bodies is
# denied by default (naryad №259); only the names listed here are opened,
# and the list is fixed in deploy/. install.sh derives the runtime value
# of METALOGOS_ENV_ALLOWLIST from this file, so a name must be added here
# first and nowhere else.
#
# One bare name per line; '#' starts a comment.
KAMERTON_TG_TOKEN
KAMERTON_CHAT_ID
KAMERTON_DB
KAMERTON_TZ_OFFSET
KAMERTON_MINIAPP_TOKEN

# Н4-08: the Moment of Power (MIND-MASTERY перенос). The secret and the
# moment texts are the OWNER's facts (issue #100 Шаг 0) — without the
# secret and the text the moment tick refuses loudly; the window defaults
# (480/1260 = 08:00–21:00) are the naryad's PROPOSAL, re-definable here
# until the owner confirms.
KAMERTON_MOMENT_SECRET
KAMERTON_MOMENT_START
KAMERTON_MOMENT_END
KAMERTON_MOMENT_TEXT
